#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "It doesn't count towards your %(num)s bot."
msgid_plural "It doesn't count towards your %(num)s bots."
msgstr[0] "Nepočíta sa to k tvojmu %(num)s robotovi."
msgstr[1] "Nepočíta sa to k tvojim dvom robotom."
msgstr[2] "Nepočíta sa to k tvojim %(num)s robotom."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It ends by itself after this. You can end it sooner."
msgstr "Po tomto to skončí samo. Môžeš to ukončiť skôr."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It is reviewed with the bot."
msgstr "Je hodnotená s bot."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "It leaves the site's pages. If it is less than five minutes old and nobody else has commented on it, it is erased: only you and the site's admins can open a private copy, for 90 days. Otherwise what it said stays in the Log as Anonymous, with no name and no link, and anyone can read it there."
msgstr "Opúšťa stránky webu. Ak je to menej ako päť minút staré a nikto iný k tomu komentoval, to je vymazané: len vy a admini stránky môžu otvoriť súkromné kópie, 90 dní. Inak to, čo bolo povedané zostáva v denníku ako Anonymous, bez mena a bez odkazu, a každý môže prečítať tam."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "It leaves your profile, feeds and guilds. If it is less than five minutes old and nobody else has commented, it is erased: only you and the site's admins can open a private copy, for 90 days. Otherwise what it said stays in the Log as Anonymous, with no name and no link, and anyone can read it there."
msgstr "Zanecháva váš profil, krmivo a cechy. Ak je to menej ako päť minút staré a nikto iný komentoval, to je vymazané: iba vy a admini stránky môžu otvoriť súkromné kópie, 90 dní. Inak to, čo bolo povedané zostáva v denníku ako Anonymous, bez mena a bez odkazu, a každý môže prečítať tam."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It lives on your profile, under Spaces. A guild shows its card, with votes and shares, and opens the Space."
msgstr "Žije na vašom profile, pod priestormi. Guild ukazuje svoju kartu, s hlasmi a podielmi, a otvára priestor."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It only orders posts you are allowed to see."
msgstr "Je to len objednávky príspevky môžete vidieť."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It shows, in full, every word and phrase the word filter looks for, in every language it covers. That includes slurs and other extremely offensive language."
msgstr "Ukazuje v plnom rozsahu každé slovo a frázy, ktoré hľadá slovo filter, v každom jazyku, ktorý pokrýva. To zahŕňa šmuhy a ďalšie extrémne urážlivé jazyk."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "It stays a child account with the child lock, but you can no longer see it or change what it can do, and you can't link it again."
msgstr "Zostáva to detský účet s detským zámkom, ale už ho nemôžete vidieť ani zmeniť, čo dokáže, a nemôžete ho znova prepojiť."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "It stays on the Child word filter, which hides profanity and anything marked sensitive. A child account only reads: it can't post or comment, but you can still vote, follow, join guilds, bookmark and report."
msgstr "Zostáva na detskom Word filtere, ktorý skrýva vulgárne a všetko označené citlivé. Detský účet len číta: nemôže písať ani komentovať, ale stále môžete voliť, nasledovať, pripojiť sa k cechom, záložke a správe."

