msgstr "Vaše ID je overené, takže nemôžete zmeniť svoje užívateľské meno."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your OneDrive is full. Free some space and try again."
msgstr "Váš OneDrive je plný. Uvoľnite priestor a skúste to znova."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your Profile"
msgstr "Váš profil"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your RSS feed address"
msgstr "Váš RSS adresa krmiva"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your Subscribed Users"
msgstr "Prihlásení používatelia"

#, glossary, machine, plain2
msgid "Your account"
msgstr "Váš účet"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account already posts automatically. Change its feeds on its page."
msgstr "Vaše konto už automaticky vystupuje. Zmeňte jeho kanály na svojej stránke."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your account balance is negative. You will not be able to participate on %(site)s until you bring your balance up to zero."
msgstr "Váš zostatok na účte je záporný. Nebudete sa môcť zúčastniť na %(site)s kým nedosiahnete svoj zostatok na nulu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account can also post new items from feeds by itself, while you keep using it as you do now. Each of those posts is marked as automated, and people who hide bot content don't see them. Your own posts, comments, votes and chats are unchanged. An admin approves it first."
msgstr "Váš účet môže tiež písať nové položky z krmív sama o sebe, zatiaľ čo budete naďalej používať ako teraz. Každý z týchto príspevkov je označený ako automatizovaný, a ľudia, ktorí skrývajú obsah robota nevidí. Vaše vlastné príspevky, pripomienky, hlasy a chaty sú nezmenené. Administrátor to najskôr schváli."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account can't post automatically while it is age-restricted."
msgstr "Váš účet nemôže automaticky písať, kým je obmedzený na vek."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account can't post automatically while it is suspended."
msgstr "Vaše konto nemôže automaticky posielať, kým je pozastavené."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account can't publish right now."
msgstr "Váš účet teraz nemôže zverejniť."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account can't run a bot while it is age-restricted."
msgstr "Váš účet nemôže viesť robot, kým je obmedzený na vek."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account cannot upload right now."
msgstr "Váš účet teraz nemôže uploadovať."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account couldn't be created. Please try again."
msgstr "Váš účet nemohol byť vytvorený. Prosím, skúste to znova."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account doesn't owe anything."
msgstr "Váš účet nič nedlhuje."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account has been checked and is ready: you can now post, comment, vote and follow. Welcome!"
msgstr "Váš účet bol skontrolovaný a je pripravený: teraz môžete písať, komentovať, hlasovať a sledovať. Vitajte!"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account has been deleted"
msgstr "Váš účet bol vymazaný"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your account has the child lock on, held by your parent or guardian, since %(date)s."
msgstr "Vaše konto zamkne dieťa, ktoré drží váš rodič alebo opatrovník, odkedy %(date)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is age-restricted, so its word filter stays on Child until you confirm your age in Settings."
msgstr "Váš účet je vekovo obmedzený, takže jeho textový filter zostáva na dieťa, kým nepotvrdíte svoj vek v Nastaveniach."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is age-restricted, so sensitive content stays hidden until you confirm your age in Settings."
msgstr "Váš účet je vekovo obmedzený, tak citlivý obsah zostáva skrytý, kým nepotvrdíte svoj vek v Nastaveniach."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is being checked"
msgstr "Vaše konto je kontrolované"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is being checked."
msgstr "Vaše konto je kontrolované."

#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid "Your account is locked until your age is confirmed, since %(date)s."
msgstr "Váš účet je zamknutý, kým nie je potvrdený váš vek, pretože %(date)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is marked sensitive."
msgstr "Váš účet je označený ako citlivý."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is no longer marked sensitive."
msgstr "Váš účet už nie je označený ako citlivý."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your account is on hold"
msgstr "Váš účet je na linke"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is suspended."
msgstr "Vaše konto je pozastavené."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is too new to write in this guild's channels yet."
msgstr "Váš účet je príliš nový na to, aby ste napísali v kanáloch tohto cechu."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account is waiting for a quick check before it can do this. To skip the wait, verify an email address in Settings > Security."
msgstr "Váš účet čaká na rýchlu kontrolu, kým to dokáže. Preskočiť čakanie, overiť e-mailovú adresu v Nastaveniach > Ochranka."

msgid ""
"Your account is waiting for a quick check before you can post, comment, vote or follow. You can look around and set up your profile in the meantime.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"To skip the wait, add and verify an email address in [Settings > Security](/settings/security)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Your account is your own now. It no longer has the child lock and your parent or guardian can no longer see it. They chose your password: change it in [Settings > Security](/settings/security), or they can still sign in as you."
msgstr ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account needs to be at least 30 days old to post automatically."
msgstr "Vaše konto musí byť aspoň 30 dní staré, aby sa automaticky."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account needs to be at least 30 days old to run a bot."
msgstr "Vaše konto musí mať aspoň 30 dní na vedenie robota."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account no longer posts automatically. Its posts stay."
msgstr "Vaše konto už nie je automaticky. Jej príspevky zostávajú."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your account only reads for now, so it can't comment. You can still vote, follow and bookmark."
msgstr "Váš účet zatiaľ len číta, takže nemôže komentovať. Stále môžete voliť, nasledovať a záložku."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account posts from these feeds from now on."
msgstr "Vaše príspevky z týchto kanálov odteraz."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account was closed"
msgstr "Váš účet bol uzavretý"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your account's automated posting has been paused: %(reason)s"
msgstr "Automatické vyslanie vášho účtu bolo zastavené: %(reason)s"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your account's automated posting is running again."
msgstr "Automatické vyslanie vášho účtu je opäť v chode."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your account's automated posting stopped reading %(url)s after %(fails)s failed tries: %(reason)s Start it again from Settings > Bots once it works."
msgstr "Automatické vyslanie účtu prestalo čítať %(url)s po neúspešných pokusoch %(fails)s: %(reason)s Spustiť znovu z nastavení > Bots akonáhle to funguje."

msgid "Your account's automated posting was approved. Your feeds' new posts appear on your profile, marked as automated, within a few minutes. Manage it in [Settings > Bots](/settings/bots)."
msgstr ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your age"
msgstr "Tvoj vek"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your age was confirmed on %(date)s."
msgstr "Váš vek bol potvrdený %(date)s."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your answer"
msgstr "Vaša odpoveď"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your appeal is waiting to be read."
msgstr "Vaša žiadosť čaká na prečítanie."

