msgstr "Aplikácie pre chat"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your chat devices"
msgstr "Vaše chatovacie zariadenia"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your chat devices can't be listed right now."
msgstr "Vaše konverzačné zariadenia teraz nemôžu byť uvedené."

msgid "Your chat encryption was started over. Messages from before can't be read on your devices unless a browser where you used chat brings them back. If this wasn't you, change your password in [Settings > Security](/settings/security)."
msgstr ""

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your chats and their keys have been removed from this browser."
msgstr "Vaše rozhovory a ich kľúče boli odstránené z tohto prehliadača."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your chats are end-to-end encrypted, and the site can't read them. The key that opens them is kept locked: once with your password, and once with the recovery code you saved when chat was set up. If you forget your password, that code is the only way to read your old messages after a reset."
msgstr "Vaše rozhovory sú end-to-end šifrované a stránka ich nevie prečítať. Kľúč, ktorý ich otvára, je zamknutý: raz s heslom a raz s kódom obnovy, ktorý ste uložili pri nastavení chatu. Ak zabudnete heslo, tento kód je jediný spôsob, ako si prečítať staré správy po resete."

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your chats run on Matrix, an open standard, on %(site)s's own chat server. Besides Chat on this site, you can use them in a Matrix app such as Element (web, desktop and the classic phone apps), FluffyChat or Cinny. They stay end-to-end encrypted there too."
msgstr "Vaše rozhovory bežia na Matrix, otvorený štandard, na %(site)sVlastný chat server. Okrem toho Diskusia na tejto stránke, môžete ich použiť v aplikácii Matrix, ako je Element (web, desktop a klasické telefónne aplikácie), FluffyChat alebo CinnyAj tam zostávajú end-to-end zašifrované."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your child accounts will be deleted with yours."
msgstr "Vaše detské účty budú vymazané s vašimi."

#, glossary, machine, plain2
msgid "Your circles"
msgstr "Vaše kruhy"

#, machine, plain1, python-format
msgid "Your circles - %(site)s"
msgstr "Vaše kruhy - %(site)s"

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your comment"
msgstr "Váš komentár"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your commenting history will show here."
msgstr "Váš komentár histórie sa ukáže tu."

#, machine, plain2
msgid "Your credit on this post is anonymous: other members see it as \"Anonymous #N\". Admins and the post's author can still see it is yours. This can't be undone."
msgstr "Váš kredit na tomto príspevku je anonymný: ostatní členovia to považujú za \"Anonymný #N.\" Administrátori a autor príspevku stále vidia, že je to vaše. Toto sa nedá odstrániť."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your curations"
msgstr "Vaše vyliečené kanály"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your custom filters have been updated"
msgstr "Vaše vlastné filtre boli aktualizované"

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your custom filters have been updated."
msgstr "Vaše vlastné filtre boli aktualizované."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your database gnome took too long looking up your question. He's been.... dealt with."
msgstr "Vaša databáza trpaslíka trvalo príliš dlho hľadať si vašu otázku. Bol... vyriešený."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your display name has been removed."
msgstr "Vaše zobrazovacie meno bolo odstránené."

#, machine, plain1
msgid "Your display name has been updated."
msgstr "Vaše zobrazenie bolo aktualizované."

#, machine, plain1
